{
  "title": "Naturally Indulgent Argentinian Chorizo Casserole",
  "description": "A rich and savory Argentinian dish featuring chorizo, perfect for a special occasion, with a lacquer glaze and herbal notes, this ovo-vegetarian friendly casserole is sure to delight.",
  "cuisine": "Argentinian",
